 "preconditions": "MEASUREMENT ONLY (bug 20260926-213955, H-WORKFF-1 part 2). Reporter fixture fx-hq1 (vars.keepMerger true, as every fx-hq1 scenario), SOLO: the client is dropped before the host hosts. Shop = the host's clothing store vars.shop (Crown Clothing). THE PLAYER IS THE ONLY CASHIER: all 14 fixture shifts cleared with `shiftclear` before entering and asserted by schedcount; then the DEV lever `work on` seats the host at the nearest register by the game's own click path, asserted with `work state` (working=True = the current PlayerActivity is a WorkActivity in state Running and the player is the station's employee). Same start as part 1: setup skip outdoors to 08:45, enter, `clock 09:59`, window opens hour 10 (asserted). NOTHING IS SAVED.",
